      "s1366": "Mar 2025 – Dec 2025",
      "s1367": "Prototype development",
      "s1368": "{@institutionalTerms.prototypeDevelopment} GENCI UDP; code not reported",
      "s1369": "Fanny Petermann-Rocha (award recipient)",
      "s1370": "Award recipient and developer alongside Alonso Pizarro",
      "s1373": "Development and validation of SCANNER, a tool for remote image-based anthropometric assessment. The support described by UDP aims to move from testing with 3D figures to validation in people, facilitating measurements for those unable to attend healthcare centres.",
      "s1374": "Anthropometry",
      "s1376": "Remote assessment",
